													},
													"string" : "KotlinObjectLiteralNode, e.g. object : Runnable { override fun run() {} } inside a function. There's no visit override, so its members are visited in the enclosing function's scope. Java precedent: {{gtMethod:GtSmaCCJavaImporter>>ensureInnerClassFrom:}} makes a FAMIXClass named after the supertype, contained in the enclosing method, with an inheritance to it."
